      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The Eurostar's standard luggage size and weight limits are 30cm x 40cm x 90cm (12\" x 16\" x 35\") for standard carry-on bags, with a maximum weight of 23kg (51lbs). Checked luggage has a maximum weight of 32kg (71lbs) and a maximum size of 75cm x 50cm x 40cm (30\" x 20\" x 16\"). For St Pancras check-in, allow at least 45 minutes to check in, pay for luggage (if applicable) and go through security before boarding your train. You can check in online up to 30 days prior to your departure, or in person at St Pancras up to 4 hours before your booked departure time.",
